  "description": "\"School Memories\" by Sharean Morishita is a powerful and thought-provoking manga that explores the impact of bullying and the importance of compassion.\n\nThis all-ages webcomic follows the lives of two school students, Colton, the class clown and Echo, the school new girl who has been a victim of bullying at every new school she has attended.\n\nWhen Colton's well-intentioned joke goes wrong, he realizes the impact his actions can have on others and begins to understand the importance of empathy and kindness.\n\nWith stunning illustrations and a touching story, \"School Memories\" is a must-read for anyone who wants to understand the power of empathy and compassion.\n\nSharean Morishita's manga provides a powerful message that will leave you inspired and uplifted, and serves as a reminder of the impact our words and actions can have on others.\n\nGet your copy today and join Colton and Echo on their journey of self-discovery and growth.",
